  "translation": [
    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is very nice. It is already nine o'clock now, and I am still sleeping. Mom says, \"Get up quickly! Today we're going to the airport together. Grandpa is about to arrive.\" I am very happy. Grandpa lives abroad, and I sometimes miss him. My younger brother is washing his hands. He says, \"Let's take the subway.\" I say, \"OK, the subway is fast.\" When we get to the airport, Grandpa is already at the door. He says with a smile, \"Hello, everyone!\" He gives me a book."
